<details class="plan-chapter" id="project-detail-2"><summary><span class="chapter-count">02</span><h3>Brighton Landscape Services Built for Colorado's Front Range</h3>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><p>Brighton sits at the northern edge of the Denver metro where the plains meet the Front Range foothills — a setting that gives properties genuine space and an open sky that most of the metro can’t match. For Brighton homeowners, that space is an opportunity. For a landscape company without deep Colorado experience, it’s also a set of conditions that are easy to get wrong.</p>
<p>The climate here is demanding in ways that catch out landscaping companies without genuine Front Range experience. Brighton’s soils trend alkaline with high clay content — drainage is a persistent challenge, and plants that aren’t selected for these conditions underperform or fail outright. Winters are cold and dry with significant freeze-thaw movement that shifts poorly built hardscape. Summers are intense at elevation with UV exposure that degrades materials and stresses poorly chosen turf and planting.</p>
<p>Ridgewell Landscape and Design has been delivering Colorado lawn and landscape services since 2011. We’ve worked across the Denver metro long enough to understand how Brighton’s specific conditions — its soils, its climate, its water context — affect landscape performance. We design and install landscapes built for this environment, not adapted from somewhere else.</p>
<p>Whether you’re a Brighton homeowner looking to transform a front yard, build out a backyard, or create a garden landscape that actually performs through Colorado seasons — or a business owner who needs a commercial landscape that makes a strong first impression — we bring the same full-service, design-to-install approach to every project.</p>

<p class="legacy-link"><a href="#contact-form">

Talk to a Landscape Designer

</a></p>

<div class="content-gallery"><img alt="patio installation aurora" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/patio-installation-aurora-1024x576.webp"/><img alt="patio pavers aurora" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/patio-pavers-aurora-1024x576.webp"/><img alt="walkway patio design aurora" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/walkway-patio-design-aurora-1024x576.webp"/></div>
</div>
